---------------------------------------------------------------------------
WDTT / qWDTT (TURN / WRAP / RAW bypass)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

Portions derived from WDTT and qWDTT (WireGuard / RAW over VK TURN),
typically licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0.

The server `bypass` image builds `wdtt-server` from:

  https://github.com/SpaceNeuroX/proxy-turn-vk-android  (qWDTT)
  https://github.com/amurcanov/proxy-turn-vk-android  (original WDTT, archived)

A small subnet patch (`server/bypass/patches/raw-subnet.patch`) aligns the
RAW TUN with nonameVPN `10.9.0.0/24`.

The Android Path B client vendors `android/go_client/` (same upstream) and
builds it as `libclient.so` via `scripts/build-bypass-client.sh`. A small
patch allows `-n` workers of 1–9 without forcing multiples of 9.

