---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Other dependencies
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Android module `android/tunnel/` vendors AmneziaWG userspace glue
(`libwg-go` JNI + `org.amnezia.awg.GoBackend` stubs) from amneziawg-android
(Apache-2.0). The shared library is built from upstream `amneziawg-go` at
build time (see `android/tunnel/tools/libwg-go/go.mod`).

Additional third-party libraries (Go modules, Android libraries, Cloudflare
WARP-related tooling such as wireproxy / tun2socks / wgcf, etc.) will be listed
here and/or in module manifests as they are vendored into the tree.

